			"hadithnumber": 4097,
			"arabicnumber": 4097,
			"text": "It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said:‘The Hour will not begin until you fight people with small eyes and small, even noses, as if their faces were hammered shields. And the Hour will not begin until you fight people whose shoes are made of hair.”",
